      "content": "that's a good start. to make my rebuttal stronger, i need to understand the specific \"evidence\" they cite. could you go into more detail on the specific types of studies or data points they usually bring up? like, how do they link things like cranial capacity or specific genetic markers to these hierarchy claims? i want to make sure i'm not oversimplifying their position when i try to debunk it.",
